    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "42 Larchfield presents a beautifully extended detached family home, just a short stroll from Dunboyne Village with its excellent selection of shops, restaurants, and amenities.  Originally a four bedroom home, the property has been thoughtfully reconfigured to create a particularly spacious bedroom, offering flexible family living. \r\nThe ground floor boasts a generous open-plan layout with a large lounge and dining area, centred around an impressive staircase. To the rear, a substantial extension provides a bespoke kitchen and large family room, overlooking the exceptionally private rear garden. \r\nBeautifully presented throughout, the front garden enjoys an attractive outlook over a large green, while the rear garden offers superb privacy along with modular shed office. This is a standout family home within easy walking distance of everything Dunboyne has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch: with porcelain tiled floor, door leading to….\r\n2.3x2.9m\r\n\r\nLounge/Dining Room: open plan with feature marble fireplace, open hearth with  gas effect fire, solid oak wood floor, bay window overlooking front garden, integrated spotlights, impressive wooden staircase, double doors to family room and kitchen \r\n9.3x8.3m\t\t\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room: with floor and wall mounted hand-painted bespoke cream kitchen featuring a gas fired range cooker, American\r\nfridge/freezer, integrated dishwasher, granite worktops. Breakfast island with built-in sink unit, integrated press units and granite worktop. \r\nPorcelain tiled floor, wooden ceiling with integrated spotlights and Velux windows, opening to… \r\n5.4x4.1m\t\t\r\n\r\nFamily Room:\twith porcelain tiled floor, wood ceiling with decorative beams and Velux windows, integrated spotlights and bay style window looking out to rear garden and door leading to rear patio \r\n8.1x4.0m\t\r\n\r\nUtility Area: with plumbed for washing machine   \r\n\r\nGuest W.C: with W.C and W.H.B, hot towel rail, porcelain tiled floor and decorative wall tiling  \r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 1: with floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes  \r\n3.5x3.3m\t \r\n\r\nBathroom/Ensuite:\twith bath, W.C and W.H.B, hot towel rail, tiled floor and fully tiled walls with integrated mirror \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: with floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes \r\n3.4x3.2m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3/4:\twith floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes, fitted desk, shelves and beds (bedroom 3 & 4 have been reconfigured to incorporate one large\r\nbedroom)\r\n7.5x3.9m\t\r\n\r\nShower Room: with rainforest shower, W.C and W.H.B, hot towel rail, fully tiled walls and tiled floor"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside\r\nWalled front garden with cobble-locked driveway and feature flowerbeds with granite pathway and feature marble garden seat \r\nFront garden overlooking large common green  \r\nRear garden cobble-locked with private patio area and walled boundary \r\nModular shed/garden room with ESB (suitable for home office or play room)\r\nRear garden not overlooked \r\n\r\nServices\r\nGFCH\r\nPVC double glazed windows \r\nFully alarmed \r\n\r\nLocal Area Information\r\nPublic transport routes that service Larchfield:\r\nBus Routes: 70 and 270 - Railway: Dunboyne Station \r\n\r\nNearby Areas: Dunboyne Village, Clonee and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre"
      },
